[by:虹烧虾的红烧鱼]
[00:00.00]作词 : Martin Jensen/Mads Dyhrberg/Jonas Kröper/Yoshi L.. H. Breen/Shannon Hilversum
[00:00.62]作曲 : Martin Jensen/Mads Dyhrberg/Jonas Kröper/Yoshi L.. H. Breen/Shannon Hilversum
[00:01.24]Oh, oh
[00:05.35]Oh, oh
[00:08.33]Stuck in a daydream, in paradise 沉浸在白日梦中的世外桃源
[00:12.41]That summer feeling, uh-uuh-oh 这夏日扑面而来的感觉
[00:16.68]Don’t need no reason, just living life 无需再多缘由 尽情享受当下就好
[00:20.64]No time for sleeping 睡眠大可置之不理
[00:22.84]
[00:23.69]So we broke some hearts and we danced on cars all night long 我们打破拘谨 在车顶彻夜跳舞
[00:27.93]Went to every bar, underneath the stars one by one 足迹遍布了夜空之下的一家又一家酒吧
[00:31.94]You told me to grow up, but I just can’t help myself 你告诉我仍需成长 但我就是无法控制自己
[00:35.95]Maybe I’m messed up, and maybe I need some help 或许我被困瓶颈 需要些的帮助
[00:39.86]
[00:40.26]Yeah I woke up with a headache and my memory’s all gone 我伴随着头痛醒来 记忆全然遗失
[00:44.21]And I spent all of my money on martinis and rum 我把所有的钱花在了马提尼和朗姆酒上
[00:48.30]Now I only got one dollar till the end of the month 现今我只剩一块钱度过这个月
[00:52.39]Should be sorry but not sorry 本该感到抱歉 但没有理由去道歉
[00:55.89]At least I had fun 至少我玩的开心
